WEBVTT

00:37:59.204 --> 00:38:02.746
I remembered in my whole life, every
relationship, every person.

00:38:03.204 --> 00:38:05.121
What a therapeutic experience.

00:38:06.496 --> 00:38:08.579
Monster was the name of your backpack,

00:38:08.579 --> 00:38:12.704
which at its heaviest weighed
nearly 70 pounds,

00:38:13.329 --> 00:38:16.746
even if even at its lightest
it was 50 pounds.

00:38:17.204 --> 00:38:21.996
And making yourself suffer in a physical
way kind of feels like

00:38:21.996 --> 00:38:26.204
the opposite of fun. And I
read that you said that

00:38:26.204 --> 00:38:31.038
the act of remembering your suffering
can become pleasure afterwards.